---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/ui/Button.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="案例">
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-[1080px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12">
      <div class="section-border pb-8 mb-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">// 案例</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">以下为代表性案例，更多详情请与我们联系。</p>
      </div>

      <article class="border border-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8 mb-8">
        <div class="section-border pb-6 mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">物语 · AI 角色聊天平台</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
            多实例部署的 AI 角色扮演对话系统，每个实例管理 30 个以内微信机器人账号，
            通过大模型驱动沉浸式角色扮演对话。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-white mb-3">// 项目概述</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">
            支持多实例部署，当前运行 4 个生产实例 + 1 个测试实例。
            每个实例可管理至多 30 个微信机器人账号，基于大模型实现角色扮演对话，
            覆盖角色设定、长期记忆、主动对话等核心能力。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-white mb-4">// 后端架构</h3>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/10">
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-gray-500 py-2 pr-4">技术</th>
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-gray-500 py-2 pr-4">版本</th>
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-gray-500 py-2">用途</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="text-gray-400">
                <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">Python</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">3.11</td><td class="py-2">运行环境</td></tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">Flask</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">3.1.3</td><td class="py-2">Web 框架，提供 REST API</td></tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">Cheroot</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">11.1.2</td><td class="py-2">生产级 HTTP 服务器</td></tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">Werkzeug</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">3.1.7</td><td class="py-2">WSGI 工具包</td></tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">websockets</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">15.0.1</td><td class="py-2">WebSocket 协议支持</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">PyInstaller</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">—</td><td class="py-2">打包为 Windows 独立可执行文件</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-white mb-4">// 前端架构</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-white/10">
            <div class="bg-midnight p-4">
              <div class="font-mono text-gray-500 text-xs mb-1">[01]</div>
              <div class="text-white text-sm font-medium">原生 ES Modules</div>
              <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1">无框架依赖，19 个 ES Module 文件，零构建工具</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-midnight p-4">
              <div class="font-mono text-gray-500 text-xs mb-1">[02]</div>
              <div class="text-white text-sm font-medium">SWR 缓存模式</div>
              <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1">自定义 Stale-While-Revalidate HTTP 客户端</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-midnight p-4">
              <div class="font-mono text-gray-500 text-xs mb-1">[03]</div>
              <div class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Server-Sent Events</div>
              <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1">实时流式输出 AI 回复</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-midnight p-4">
              <div class="font-mono text-gray-500 text-xs mb-1">[04]</div>
              <div class="text-white text-sm font-medium">原生 CSS + 主题切换</div>
              <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1">CSS 自定义属性，支持亮/暗主题</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-white mb-4">// AI 与数据处理</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="border border-white/10 p-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs border border-neon-cyan/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-neon-cyan">LLM</span>
                <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">多供应商大模型接入</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">
                主力模型为小米 MIMO v2.5，同时兼容 DeepSeek 及 OpenAI 标准接口，支持灵活切换。
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-white/10 p-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs border border-neon-purple/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-neon-purple">MCP</span>
                <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Model Context Protocol</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">
                基于 Anthropic MCP v1.27 协议，集成网页搜索、图片识别等外部工具能力。
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="border border-white/10 p-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs border border-neon-purple/30 px-2 py-0.5 text-neon-purple">记忆</span>
                <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">长期对话记忆</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">
                LLM 自动总结对话摘要，按重要性评分管理长期记忆，支持角色主动发起对话。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-white mb-4">// 存储方案</h3>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/10">
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-gray-500 py-2 pr-4">类型</th>
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-gray-500 py-2 pr-4">格式</th>
                  <th class="text-left font-mono text-gray-500 py-2">说明</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="text-gray-400">
                <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">配置文件</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">YAML</td><td class="py-2">LLM 供应商、角色配置、聊天参数</td></tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">对话记录</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">JSON</td><td class="py-2">每次对话完整消息历史</td></tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">账号数据</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">JSON</td><td class="py-2">微信机器人凭证与绑定关系</td></tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-white/5"><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">角色设定</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono">JSON</td><td class="py-2">30 个角色提示词模板</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono text-neon-cyan">存储策略</td><td class="py-2 pr-4 font-mono" colspan="2">全文件系统存储，无 SQL / NoSQL 依赖</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-white mb-4">// 微信集成</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-white/10">
            <div class="bg-midnight p-4 text-center">
              <div class="text-white font-mono font-bold text-lg">ilink</div>
              <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-mono mt-1">微信 ilink 协议</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-midnight p-4 text-center">
              <div class="text-white font-mono font-bold text-lg">扫码登录</div>
              <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-mono mt-1">扫码认证 + Token 持久化</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-midnight p-4 text-center">
              <div class="text-white font-mono font-bold text-lg">双向路由</div>
              <div class="text-gray-500 text-xs font-mono mt-1">微信 ↔ 本地大模型消息路由</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 border border-neon-purple/20 p-6">
          <p class="text-white text-lg font-bold mb-2">开始使用物语</p>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4">选择适合你的方案，30 个 AI 角色等你来创建</p>
          <Button variant="primary" href="/payment">查看定价方案</Button>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
